@base_url = http://localhost:8080

### Get All Email Sent
GET {{base_url}}/api/email-sent

### Get Email Sent by ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/email-sent/1

### Create Email Sent
POST {{base_url}}/api/email-sent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1001,
  "idAccount": 5,
  "sentDate": "2026-01-15",
  "sentTimestamp": "2026-01-15T09:00:00"
}

### Update Email Sent
PUT {{base_url}}/api/email-sent/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1001,
  "idAccount": 5,
  "sentDate": "2026-01-20",
  "sentTimestamp": "2026-01-20T10:00:00"
}

### Delete Email Sent
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/email-sent/1001

### Get Email Sent by Account ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/email-sent/account/5